<h2>What is Office Interior Guide?</h2>
<p>Office Interior Guide is part of Woodex Interior's complete service architecture — 7 main: Commercial (Office Interior Design, Corporate Interior Design, Software House Interior, Retail Showroom Shop, Restaurant Café, Healthcare Pharmacy) and Delivery (Fit-Out Office Commercial Healthcare Turnkey, Renovation Office Commercial F&B Healthcare Residential, Project Delivery Turnkey PMC Site Supervision BOQ Vendor Management, 3D Studio Interior Architectural Rendering Animation Walkthrough Virtual Tours, Architecture Space Planning Residential 3-4 Kanal Farmhouse Commercial Front Elevation).</p>

<p>For office interior guide, Woodex follows the 7-gate process: Discover (brief — what space is today, must become, usage, city, budget band, plan/photos — consultation, site survey), Design (space planning, concept, materials, moodboard, drawings — plan first, then still), Visualize (3D stills first — one per key room, in-house not render farm, walkthrough/360 only if path matters, BOQ later — DRAWN. THEN BUILT.), Plan (budget with clarity, BOQ turns still into buildable scope, cost planning, vendor management, no fake sqft rate), Build (civil, MEP, execution, site supervision, ISO 9001, mill connected to still, kitchens/wardrobes/counters drawn then made), Install (furniture, joinery, lighting, signage, branding, MEP final), Deliver (handover, snag list, warranty, aftercare — Turnkey goes all gates under one contract, one PM accountable).</p>

